A new forum tool is added.

http://mw.lojban.org/index.php/Special:AWCforum/

e-mail notifications are working.
In order to create an avatar upload an image using normal mediawiki upload 
tool (http://mw.lojban.org/index.php/Special:Upload) and then opening 
http://mw.lojban.org/index.php/Special:AWCforum/member_options/editava

and pasting the name of your file in [[File: ..... . jpg]] format.

Some features are not working. And won't work as the extension is quite old 
there are no other good forum extensions for mediawiki.

You can see some lojbanists already adding topic there.

On Tuesday, July 30, 2013 6:19:38 PM UTC+4, la arxokuna wrote:
>
> Today I added a new extension.
> http://mw.lojban.org/index.php/Special:WikiForum
>
> It allows discussions in phpbb-like forums. Some of us dislike mailing 
> list format so here is the alternative.
> Of course it doesn't have such allegedly nice features as use avatars or 
> similar. It's just for work. And integrated into LMW.
>
> You need to be registered on LMW to open new threads and add replies. 
> Quoting previous messages is possible (there is a toolbar near each post).
>
>

